{"canonical_record":{"canonical_payload_sha256":"e88f3d81d813e758c00b4b186591a9297324d7388231bb331bdb7ce3c3a9f7c3","full_review_record_id":"fullrev_0523bb9c39133282b4e5307c14b73865cfe34dddbf4ff2e585c7d42217d03708","overall_assessment":"The paper presents a technical contribution to video captioning without a dedicated section on ethics, privacy, or broader societal impact. The supplied evidence is insufficient to determine compliance with specific venue policies regarding anonymity, plagiarism, or mandatory impact statements, as no such policy documents or external overlap checks are available.","paper_id":"ByG4hz5le","paper_identity_sha256":"d96482708ac5ccddc8ef5f95deaffb5b1feb2162b705fdf85b1b1c9743c8f33b","prompt_identity_sha256":"4904d98777fcacc1cdda27ead3732f27ac543452803ae3137ca5b655874e6c0e","raw_response_sha256":"acf7a7b003e0f8d835ba614ec9406acfe5e3a561c5187b40600af40f68e74756","request_identity_sha256":"1f42fbb19b692412d52dc27ad51fc5903359e67240c60c823c0d24ff83942880","reviewer_identity_sha256":"c1cd7c7fdd4a2cbeb45c2f21af982ad0f30bffae8ae148e3eba36479685cf360","role":"POL","schema_version":"agentreview-full-review-corpus-v4","structural_context_sha256":"9a405c8345a8cd1318347542367e25d1399dd10a0c26d0965fce2875a49d3b6a","subdimension_sections":[{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The paper does not contain a dedicated discussion of ethical risks, fairness, bias, or potential harms associated with the video captioning model. The focus is strictly on the technical performance of the adaptive feature abstraction mechanism. No specific ethical mitigation strategies or considerations for marginalized populations are addressed in the provided text.","subdimension_id":"POL-ETH"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-029","SRC-030"],"review_text":"The paper utilizes three benchmark datasets: YouTube2Text, M-VAD, and MSR-VTT. The text describes the dataset splits and vocabulary sizes but does not explicitly discuss data licensing, consent, or privacy compliance for the video clips and captions used. The use of public benchmark datasets is standard, but the paper does not provide specific evidence of adherence to privacy regulations or licensing terms for the underlying media.","subdimension_id":"POL-DAT"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-001"],"review_text":"The title page lists the authors' names, institutional affiliations (Duke University, NEC Laboratories America), and email addresses. Without a frozen venue-specific anonymity policy for the 2017 ICLR submission, it is not possible to declare a double-blind violation. However, the presence of these identifiers is noted as a factual observation of the paper's metadata.","subdimension_id":"POL-ANO"},{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The supplied evidence does not include external plagiarism checks, overlap analysis, or information regarding dual submission. Therefore, it is not possible to confirm or deny originality or the absence of dual submission based solely on the provided paper text and anchors.","subdimension_id":"POL-PLG"},{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The paper does not include a broader impact statement, a responsible AI checklist, or explicit documentation of IRB/ethics approvals. As no frozen policy obligation for these specific documents is provided in the evidence boundary, the absence of these sections is noted as a limitation of the supplied text rather than a confirmed policy violation.","subdimension_id":"POL-IMP"}]},"disposition":"CANONICAL_FULL_REVIEW_COMMITTED","item_commit_sha256":"71993a1229b26ba68d71291b2be0a70712ec3a218390843e8e95bba960c6b384","paper_id":"ByG4hz5le","paper_ordinal":68,"raw_attempts":[{"assistant_content_base64":"","assistant_content_sha256":"acf7a7b003e0f8d835ba614ec9406acfe5e3a561c5187b40600af40f68e74756","attempt_index":0,"error":"","finish_reason":"stop","paper_id":"ByG4hz5le","raw_provider_response_base64":"","raw_provider_response_sha256":"014fdd731d005504cdce48aa450b19c27388c30acdc8f1c7cc1f485c38bb6244","request_identity_sha256":"1f42